        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bi ram ɔ dueerkɛ pɛn ni wi̱i̱dɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä ɛn ɣöö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ɛŋu lotdi mɔ kɛ cäät ɛmɛ kɛ kui̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n I-thɛ-rɛl mɔ nyio̱o̱ki jɛ mɔ, mɔ ruac i̱ mɔ, “Ci diëëth dɛy naywali ti /ken buɔɔr cam, kä cɛ lɛc gan där kɛ wacdiɛn?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ce̱tnikɛ min tëkä, ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial, ɛn cäät ɛmɛ /cia jɛ bi nyɔk kɛ la̱t kä I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bi yɛn ɛ dhil ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö yiey diaal kɛ nyinkä, tëk diëëthni kɛnɛ tëk gan kɛ nyinkä. Jɛn ram ɔ bi duer la̱t ɔ bi li̱w ni jɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi te raan kɛ cuŋ kä lätdɛ ni ŋut kɛnɛ thuɔ̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi /ci ram ɛmɔ bi mi̱th gua̱thni tin thöpkɛ muc kuthni baaŋ thi̱n, kä /cɛ kuth baaŋ thuɔk duëël ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl bi guic, kä /cɛ ciek raam mi thieekɛ jɛ bi ka̱n, kä /cɛ bi tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ ciek kɛ gua̱a̱th tëë in kɛ buɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ ram mi bɛ yak, kä bɛ ram min tekɛ ŋua̱l kɛ jɛ luɔ̱c duŋdɛ, kä thilɛ ram mi bɛ mac, a bɛ moc ni ram mi näk buɔthɛ kɛ mieth, kä bɛ ram mi jäl juutdä moc kɛ bi̱i̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /cɛ ŋua̱l tho̱p kɛ ɣöö bɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r jek thi̱n, kä bɛ lätni kä mi jiääk lo̱k, kä latdɛ luk kam nɛɛni tin go̱o̱ny kɛ thuɔ̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä guurɛ ni ŋuɔ̱tkä, kä kääpɛ luëëkä agɔaa, kä lätdɛ kɛ ŋa̱th mi thuɔ̱k, jɛn ram ɛmɔ ɛ gua̱n cuŋni. Ɛ puc, jɛn ram ɛmɔ bɛ tëk, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi tëë kɛ gat mi gua̱n köör, kä ɛ nääk nath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi bɛ ŋɔak ti̱ti̱ la̱t (a cäŋɛ ni mëë /ken gua̱n duɔ̱ɔ̱r kɛl la̱t thi̱n) mi wëë mi̱th kä ri̱ŋ tin thöpkɛ kuth guääyni, kä bɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ ciek raam mi thieek kɛ jɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä bɛ ga̱y kɛnɛ can yɔŋ, kä macɛ naath, kä /cɛ ŋua̱l luc gua̱ndɛ, kä palɛ kuth guäyni a lätdɛ nyuɔɔn ti jiäk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä tho̱pɛ ŋua̱l kɛ ɣöö bɛ rëëp jek thi̱n. Jɛn ram ɔ bɛ tëk? Jɛn /cɛ bi tëk. Cɛ kɛn nyuɔɔn ti̱ti̱ diaal dhil kɛ lätni, kɛ thuɔ̱k bɛ dhil li̱w, bi riɛmdɛ pɛn ni wi̱i̱dɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duundɛ ɣöö mi te raan kɛ gat, mi nɛɛn dueer diaal tin ci gua̱n kɛ la̱t, kä /kenɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni duɔ̱ɔ̱p gua̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä jɛn /kenɛ mi̱th kɛ ri̱ŋ tin ca thöp kuth guäyni, kä /ken ɛ kuth guäyni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl pal, kä /ken tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ ciek raam mi thieek kɛ jɛ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä thilɛ ram mi cɛ duer duer, kä lucɛ ŋua̱l gua̱ndɛ, kä /cɛ naath mac, ɛ tho̱pɛ mi̱eth nɛy tin näk buɔthkɛ, kä mocɛ nɛy tin te juutdä kɛ bi̱i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä lo̱kɛ la̱t kä mi jiääk, kä /cɛ rëëp jek kä ŋua̱l in cɛ thöp, kä kääpɛ ŋuɔ̱tkä kä tiitdɛ luëëkä, jɛn ram ɛmɛ ɔ /cɛ bi li̱w kɛ dueer gua̱n, ɛ puc jɛn bɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱n ti jiäk la̱t, kä cɛ dämani mac, kä cɛ ŋɔak ti jia̱k jia̱a̱k la̱t rɛy nɛɛnikɛ, bɛ li̱w kɛ kui̱ dueerikɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ŋotdɛ thiec yɛn i̱, ‘Ɛŋu /ci gat dee li̱w ɔ kɛ kui̱ dueeri gua̱n?’ Kä jɛn gat mi cɛ la̱t ni ŋuɔ̱t kɛnɛ thuɔ̱k, kä cɛ luëëkä, diaal tit agɔaa, jɛn bɛ dhil tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi ram in ci dueer la̱t li̱w. Kä /ci gat bi cuuc kɛ kui̱ dueeri diëëthnikɛ, kä /ci diëëth bi cuuc kɛ kui̱ dueeri gankiɛn. Kä bi cuŋ raam mi lät cuŋ a ni nyinkɛ, kä bi dueer raam mi lät dueer a ni nyinkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duundɛ ɣöö mi ci ji̱ dueeri rɔ̱ ri̱t kä dueerkiɛn diaal tëë ci kɛn kɛ la̱t, kä bikɛ ŋuɔ̱tkä diaal luɔ̱th, ɛ bikɛ la̱t ni min la ŋut kɛnɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ, ɛ puc /cikɛ bi li̱w, bikɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ duer kɛl kä dueer tëë cikɛn kɛ la̱t mi ba nyɔk kɛ ti̱em kɛ kui̱diɛn. Kɛ kui̱ cuŋni tin ci kɛn kɛ la̱t, bikɛ tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ dëë lɔcdä ku gɔaa kɛ lia̱a̱ ji̱ dueeri ɛ /cä dëë ku go̱r ni ɣöö bikɛ rɔ̱ ri̱t kä dupkiɛn tin jiäk kɛ ɣöö bikɛ tëk? Ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ mi ci nɛy tin la̱tkɛ cuŋ rɔ̱ ri̱t lätni cuŋnikiɛn, ɛ la̱tkɛ ni dueer kɛnɛ jiäk tin la̱tkɛ ɛ ji̱ nyuɔɔni, kɛn dëë kɛ tëk? Thil ɛ la̱t cuŋä kɛl kä lät cuŋnikiɛn mi ba lɛ tim. Kɛ kui̱ thil ŋäthä mi lätdɛ ni jiäk kɛnɛ dueer tin cikɛn kɛ la̱t, bikɛ li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä ŋotdɛ ruac yɛn i̱, ‘Min lät Kuäär ni Kuoth ɛ /ciɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ.’ Liɛŋɛ jɛ lö thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl. /Cikɛ lätkun kɛn tin /ci tɔ̱ a thuɔ̱ɔ̱k tɔ̱? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi ci ji̱ cuŋni rɔ̱ ri̱t lätni cuŋnikiɛn, ɛ cikɛ la̱t ni dueer, kɛn bikɛ li̱w, kɛ kɛn dueer bakɛ näk tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ rɛwdɛ, mi ci ji̱ dueeri rɔ̱ ri̱t kä lät dueerikiɛn, a wäkɛ la̱t ni ŋuɔ̱t kɛnɛ thuɔ̱ɔ̱k nhiamdä, bikɛ tëkdiɛn kän. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ kä ɣöö ci kɛn thuɔ̱k ŋa̱c, kä cikɛ rɔ̱ ri̱t duɔ̱pnikiɛn kɛnɛ päliɛn kɛ dueer diaal tëë cikɛn kɛ la̱t, ɛ puc bikɛ tëk, /cikɛ bi li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ŋotdɛ ruac thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl i̱, ‘Min lät Kuäär ni Kuothɛ /ciɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ.’ Kɛn lätkä /cikɛ cuŋ lö thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl? /Cikɛ lätkun kɛn tin /ci tɔ̱ a thuɔ̱ɔ̱k tɔ̱?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ɣän bä ji̱ luk lö thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl, yɛn diaal bä yɛ luk ce̱tnikɛ duɔ̱pkun, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial. Rietdɛ rɔ̱ kä dueerkun diaal, kiɛ bi dueerkun yɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wuɔcɛ dueer tin ci yɛn kɛ lät kä ɣä, Kä gɛ̈rɛ cärkun kɛnɛ lo̱ckun akɛ puɔth! Ɛŋu bia li̱w ɔ lö thok duëël I-thɛ-rɛl? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci lɔcdä dëë tɛɛth kɛ lia̱a̱ ran, rietdɛ rɔ̱ bia cu tëk, ruac ni ɣän Kuäär ni Kuoth Nhial.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
